{"reviewId": "339597203_879LKwKVq", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "前面说到共生模式下资源品价格的调节机制，在这个机制下，若不控制好美元资产的膨胀，泡沫破裂时全球会陷入衰退，最好的结果就是资产停止膨胀且泡沫不破，这是商品价格见顶时我们可能会看到的现象。接下来讲的是从周期角度看的实体经济与虚拟经济繁荣的关系，当实体经济过于繁荣，获利机会会减少，那么多出来的钱会自然而然出现对虚拟经济的需求，钱就会流入到虚拟经济中。当实体经济的高峰过去，资源品由于滞后，并不能迅速从供给短缺中解放，所以资源品依旧继续高涨，这有点像惯性。所以实体经济后的虚拟经济繁荣，并不能当做对未来趋势的判断，反而要警惕顶部的来临。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "不要被代表着过去的繁荣迷惑", "range": "21793-21806", "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "339597203_879LKwKVq", "userVid": 339597203, "topics": [], "createTime": 1771927095, "userEditTime": 1771927406, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 339597203, "name": "中国王骄傲", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELEI69eCWLF67iadJVmr29SceyhP68EF0eHJNibKs1EhbJenib3uOP8HG3Dvf5kJOdsKDJMrGnDmticvW4DStmITntKkQuKgP0yXHicptibDQlq8WVA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-1-0-H-0-0-0", "desc": "微信读书·学生勋章", "title": "学生认证", "levelIndex": 1}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 928448853, "name": "贾晓璟 ", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PMdyqb5x5xQjEftHEpiab0jhIG36wq3JArAt81NULmPUvuFiaBRrFsDAaOdN3CSic0IXs4NiaiarX8lLNUpSa1n2QXCibfm9rI1zqZSFY6XSEIicJE/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo